ion was pursued before closing the UI build.\n\n[L469] The biggest bleed was **not unrelated project data**.\n\n[L471] It was **governance depth bleeding into implementation depth**.\n\n---\n\n[L475] # H. SLICE AUDIT\n\n[L477] | Slice / PassWhy it existedConcrete artifactNecessary?Could be absorbed? |                                         |                                  |                                                 |                                                       |\n[L478] | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n[L479] | Slice 1 — Baseline React                                                | Original requested vertical slice       | React slate + Baseline drilldown | **Yes**                                         | No                                                    |\n[L480] | Slice 1 SHA repair                                                      | Real certification defect               | standards-compliant SHA + tests  | **Yes**                                         | Yes, normal fix cycle                                 |\n[L481] | Slice 1 re-verification                                                 | Confirm SHA repair                      | Luce PASS                        | **Yes**                                         | Appropriate one reverify                              |\n[L482] | Slice 2 — Don Delta                                                     | Explicitly authorized product expansion | Don Delta view/ledger/workflow   | **Yes for expanded scope**                      | No                                                    |\n[L483] | Pre-Slice-3 clock/vocab repair                                          | Fix Slice-2 debt                        | RunClock + canonical vocab       | **Yes before synthesis**                        | **Yes**, could have been Slice-2 closure              |\n[L484] | Re-verification of repair                                               | Verify bounded repair                   | 94/94 certification              | Reasonable                                      | Could stay one closure pass                           |\n[L485] | Slice 3 — generic synthesis shell                                       | Third product state                     | real shell/UI/API/ledger         | **Yes if synthesis in scope**                   | No                                                    |\n[L486] | Slice 3 shell verification                                              | Independent check                       | 114/114 verified                 | Reasonable                                      | Normal                                                |\n[L487] | Corrado canonical synthesis definition                                  | Fill explicit SPORT GAP                 | quantitative rule spec           | Needed only for canonical execution             | **Outside original DevPad ask**                       |\n[L488] | Nico MLB math core                                                      | Implement Corrado math                  | `mlb_ecq_synthesis_v1.ts`        | Needed only for canonical execution             | Could be separate project/pass                        |\n[L489] | Luce math-core verification                                             | Check math                              | PASS                             | Useful                                          | Normal                                                |\n[L490] | Lane-map correction                                                     | Real discrepancy                        | corrected 5/7/5 lane sets        | Yes if core pursued                             | Could be same math-core fix cycle                     |\n[L491] | Lane-map re-verification         