n inside the experimental MLB lane.\n\n---\n\n[L58] # C. ACTUAL WORK PERFORMED\n\n[L60] Only concrete work that was actually reported as built, changed, verified, or produced is included here.\n\n[L62] ### MLB cleanup / recon\n\n[L64] The session began from a completed estate recon:\n\n[L66] - 506-file estate inventoried and hash-verified.\n[L67] - 11 recon deliverables produced.\n[L68] - 50 exact-duplicate groups identified.\n[L69] - 71 lineage families identified.\n[L70] - 12 supersession chains identified.\n[L71] - 4 quarantine candidates identified.\n[L72] - 0 delete candidates identified.\n[L73] - Identity anomalies and schema gaps documented.\n[L74] - `float(IP)` defects identified.\n[L75] - generic `(\"OUT\",\"IL\")` counting identified.\n[L76] - triple-run identical-output anomaly identified.\n[L77] - cleanup decision register prepared.\n\n[L79] ### 2026-09-24 MLB live experimental run\n\n[L81] Falcon produced a real pregame frozen evidence package:\n\n[L83] - 12/12 games collected.\n[L84] - markets present across five books; Bet365/Circa gaps explicitly accepted.\n[L85] - 72 odds rows.\n[L86] - starters 23/24.\n[L87] - bullpen 24/24 with 450 relievers.\n[L88] - injuries and roster data collected.\n[L89] - weather 12/12.\n[L90] - frozen snapshot `20260924_151712`.\n[L91] - regression scripts passed.\n[L92] - prior day artifacts untouched.\n\n[L94] That was a **visible, runnable milestone**.\n\n[L96] The experimental engine then actually ran against the frozen package:\n\n[L98] - 11/12 games analyzed.\n[L99] - MIL\\@PHI failed closed.\n[L100] - full market grid produced.\n[L101] - six original ML review rows surfaced.\n[L102] - 14 reported ≥7% conflict rows surfaced.\n[L103] - negative-EV rows retained.\n[L104] - odds-consumption perturbation test proved BetMGM prices were actually consumed.\n\n[L106] This was another **visible outcome**.\n\n[L108] ### Kimi corrective work\n\n[L110] Concrete defects were found and corrected:\n\n[L112] - run-line lane confirme