or — still very plausible**  \n**2. MGM Wi-Fi intermittent behavior — still plausible**  \n**3. Your local Wi-Fi adapter/radio — possible, not proven**  \n**4. General Internet packet loss — currently looks unlikely**\n\nAnd if Space Bunny is stalling repeatedly **while normal browsing and other services keep working**, I would actually become *more* suspicious of the **OpenCode → Bedrock Mantle streaming/runtime path**, not your laptop.\n\nThe monitor is useful because the next real stall should finally tell us which direction to go. If the probes stay green during the stall, **we stop fucking with the network and go directly after Space Bunny/OpenCode/Bedrock.**", "text_chars": 1387, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "c4441730-a7bb-4511-9037-4560a0ea1aa4", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790373278.673, "updated_at": 1790373293.614002, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Okay, fuck this. I gotta pull this out of here. Ground yourself. You're not even in the session framework. That's not what I asked. Space Bunny does not use the Bedrock mantle.", "text_chars": 176, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 0, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "f6112346-c8e8-40df-be51-2c34bd9e36b0", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790373283.88825, "updated_at": 1790373283.88825, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "empty_text_parts": 